                "text": "As I travel around the Sunshine State, one thing folks continue to tell me is that they\u2019re worried about the rising cost of flood insurance. \n\nThat is why I, along with @SenRickScott, are working to ease the financial burden on Florida families by proposing a bill that would create a tax deduction on their flood insurance premiums.\n\nThe Flood Insurance Relief Act is a critical solution that will directly benefit Floridians.",
